# Ready Cargo Packer - English source catalog

## Shared metadata
meta-home-title = Ready Cargo Packer, a sturdier, more complete aproach to planning for multiple containers
meta-home-description = Ready Cargo Packer is a CAD software to plan cargo loadouts: real-time 3D placement for many containers at once, inventory editor, and a still growing roadmap.
meta-about-title = About - Ready Cargo Packer
meta-about-description = Meet the Ready Cargo Packer team and learn about the project behind a new approach to container load planning.
meta-contact-title = Contact - Ready Cargo Packer
meta-contact-description = Get in touch with the Ready Cargo Packer team to sponsor the project, share feedback, or discuss the roadmap.
meta-roadmap-title = Roadmap - Ready Cargo Packer
meta-roadmap-description = The Ready Cargo Packer roadmap: work completed so far, what we are building next, and the long-term vision for the project.

