## Home page
home-hero-status = Coming soon
home-hero-heading = Loadout planning with no guesswork.
home-hero-description = Ready Cargo Packer is being built as a desktop software for planning load layouts, managing inventory, and preparing clear loading plans, all of it across several containers at once.
home-hero-roadmap-link = View the roadmap
home-hero-contact-link = Contact Us
home-stat-containers-value = { $count }
home-stat-containers = Containers at once
home-stat-live-preview-value = 3D
home-stat-live-preview = Live preview
home-stat-packing-time-value = { $seconds }s
home-stat-packing-time = Automatic packing time
home-hero-image-alt = Ready Cargo Packer 3D loading viewport showing a container packed with color-coded boxes
home-features-eyebrow = Desktop-first by design
home-features-heading = More information in every screen, without adding noise.
home-features-description = Inventory, load visibility, and action appear together so the first desktop glance is immediately useful. It runs offline as a native desktop tool, or in the browser, for teams on the field like in the office.
home-feature-placement-title = Automatic and manual placement
home-feature-placement-description = Let the engine propose a tight baseline, then drag, rotate, and fine-tune every box by hand.
home-feature-inventory-title = Inventory anchored to the view
home-feature-inventory-description = Import all inventory at once, merge multiple files, and edit safely while the 3D load stays in context — no buried modals or spreadsheet juggling.
home-feature-interface-title = Snappy and fluent interface
home-feature-interface-description = Build on Rust, every interaction is milliseconds-fast. Smart alignment and hints make tight, stable packs pleasant to build.
home-feature-workflow-title = Low-click, keyboard support and fast workflow
home-feature-workflow-description = UX designed for speed of use. Customizable key-binds and contextual shortcuts make packing much faster with regular operators.
home-feature-inspection-title = Live 3D load inspection
home-feature-inspection-description = Solid or transparent rendering, hover dimensions, and corner markers show exactly what is happening inside the container.
home-feature-packing-title = Built around real packing problems
home-feature-packing-description = Packing boxes is not all maths; Our software is built rugged. It can allow short overhangs, stacking boxes on <i>mostly</i> flush surfaces and bridging over gaps.
home-inventory-eyebrow = Inventory panel
home-inventory-heading = A clearer way to prepare inventory, for the whole shippment and all in one place.
home-inventory-description = The planned inventory workspace will bring files, edits, and load progress together. The aim is to replace back-and-forth spreadsheet work with one single view of the shipment.
home-inventory-tag-search = Live search
home-inventory-tag-import = Import & merge files
home-inventory-tag-editing = Safe editing
home-inventory-image-alt = Ready Cargo Packer inventory panel listing box categories with loading progress bars
home-viewport-eyebrow = 3D viewport
home-viewport-heading = Place fast, align tight, inspect everything.
home-viewport-description = Drag and drop boxes manually, snap to near-flush surfaces and container edges, or let the automatic engine build a dense starting point. Visualize the loadout with the layered / transparent view, as well as the box types distribution.
home-viewport-tag-baseline = Auto pack baseline
home-viewport-tag-snapping = Snapping & alignment
home-viewport-tag-hover = Highlight on hover
home-viewport-image-alt = Ready Cargo Packer 3D container view with corner points and a hover tooltip
home-teaser-eyebrow = On the roadmap
home-teaser-heading = Features we are building for practical load planning.
home-teaser-roadmap-link = See the full roadmap →
home-teaser-next-status = Next up
home-teaser-reports-title = Loading plan reports
home-teaser-reports-description = PDF reports and load summaries for clearer handoffs to drivers and clients.
home-teaser-editing-title = Extensive manual editing
home-teaser-editing-description = Reposition placed boxes precisely with snapping and context-aware editing. Fill gaps quickly with smart-fill or duplicate placed boxes right from the viewport
home-teaser-future-status = Future vision
home-teaser-containers-title = Multiple containers
home-teaser-containers-description = Plan across entire shipments, with multiple containers in view at once, and automatic packing working across all of these containers.
home-cta-heading = Built in the open, with your support.
home-cta-description = Ready Cargo Packer is under active development. Share your workflow to help guide the project toward the problems that matter most.
home-cta-link = Get in touch

